# Cursor rules — College Desktop (Tauri)

## Scope

This repository is the **Tauri** desktop app under `CollegeDesktop/`. Do not reintroduce a Swift/Xcode tree.

## UI

- Primitives and tokens: `CollegeDesktop/src/design-system/`
- Screens: `CollegeDesktop/src/modules/`
- Tracker: `docs/PATH_C_VISUAL_FIDELITY.md`, catalog: `docs/UI_CATALOG.md`

## Backend

- Rust IPC/commands: `CollegeDesktop/src-tauri/src/commands/`
- DB schema/migrations: `CollegeDesktop/src-tauri/src/db/`

## Verify

```bash
cd CollegeDesktop && bun run typecheck
bash scripts/check-tauri-parity.sh
```

## Commits

Smallest correct diff. Do not commit unless asked.
